# Third-party notices

## AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry

The embedded filter/service catalog in
`crates/sito-clients/src/catalog/catalog.json` is generated from the metadata
indexes published by the AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry project:

- Project: <https://github.com/AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry>
- Filter index: <https://adguardteam.github.io/HostlistsRegistry/assets/filters.json>
- Service index: <https://adguardteam.github.io/HostlistsRegistry/assets/services.json>

HostlistsRegistry is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
sito is licensed under GPL-3.0-only, so embedding the metadata is compatible
with both licenses. The upstream license text is available in the upstream
repository and at <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html>.

Only **metadata** is embedded: filter names, categories, descriptions,
homepages, download/subscription URLs, versions, refresh intervals, languages,
deprecation flags, and the blocked-service names, groups and short service
block rules. No filter-list text or other filter-list body is included, and no
SVG icons are embedded. Filter lists themselves are downloaded at runtime from
their published URLs when selected by an operator; the catalog is not fetched
at runtime.

The catalog is generated by `scripts/generate-catalog.py`. See
`docs/catalog.md` for the release-bound update policy.
